Z||000000||theogre||10-20-2000||12:05 AM||||As many of you know Cliff has been hosting my Fiero pages on his servers. The volume of space and time he's given me to do this is greatly appreciated.<P>As many of you also know I went thru Chemo Therapy over the summer. That’s eaten a big chunk of my year. (For those of you following that, I’m over Chemo and back to work. Some final surgery is being planned to make sure all affected areas are clear. That should happen between now and year end.)<P>In order to reduce some of my own confusion and consolidate my work I will not be posting updates to Cliff. Instead Tunnel#6 is now available thru my main cave <A HREF="http://home.sprynet.com/~theogre" TARGET=_blank>http://home.sprynet.com/~theogre</A>  or directly thru <A HREF="http://home.sprynet.com/~theogre/tunnel6/index.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://home.sprynet.com/~theogre/tunnel6/index.htm</A>  I’ve given Cliff a new index page so that you will still be able to access the cave from the existing links.<P>Channel support has now been officially added so Internet Exploder 4+ users can view the site offline. The channel is currently configured to update about every 21 days. I will likely be changing that schedule in the future but every 3 weeks seemed good for now.<P>For those of you who wander the rest of my site, I am aware that there are many broken links. This was caused by Mindspring or Earthlink moving the site to new servers. The new servers are having a crap over case usage. The old server didn’t care about case of the text in links. So now I have to work my way thru the whole place and fix everything.<P>Once again I’d like to thank Cliff for storing the pages. We’ve had a bunch of fun with all this even if we never did manage to meat up anyplace. (And the rat still owes me a martini.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> )<BR>||||reg||6
Z||000001||theogre||10-30-2000||11:05 PM||||Update:<P>The Fiero Tunnel now has a shorter URL.<BR> <A HREF="http://fierocave.shorturl.com" TARGET=_blank>http://fierocave.shorturl.com</A> <P>I'm trying out this service so this may not stay if they prove to be a pain.<BR>||||reg||1
